# Profile fields that the Phase 6 STIC and video rules name and the profile does not have yet (plan 06-01, D-04, D-23).
# One line per field: `<field> <owning plan>`. The video step requires every field of a rule of data/stic/rules.json that is not
# `engine:<name>` to be a line of data/expected/profile-fields.ids or a line here, and a line here whose field is already in the profile
# to be deleted (tokens video-rule-field-unregistered and video-pending-stale): the owning plan deletes its lines in the same commit that
# adds the field. Plan 06-04 adds the 33 profile fields (generator, tags, discrepancy ids); plan 06-06 adds the memory-system device
# kind that makes memmap.device.stic14 a profile field.
# Plan 08-03 (VID-05 oracle plan): the profile fields of the rules STIC-R37 to STIC-R50; each owner plan deletes its lines in the commit that adds the field (one tier 4 field, ten pinned defaults).
video.collision_x0_interacts 08-05
video.collision_border_bit 08-05
video.collision_offscreen 08-05
video.collision_display_off 08-05
video.border_ext_strip 08-06
video.border_follows_delay 08-06
video.delay_exposed_fill 08-06
video.delay_mob_in_exposed 08-06
